{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109687","id":2751082335,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6j-i9f","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109687","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109687.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109687.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109687","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109687/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109687/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109687/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e98148b60d9a9322f05988d22e46befda20b0c5b","number":109687,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add Vector constructors that accepts a single scalar or no arguments.","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"GDScript Example:\r\n```gdscript\r\n# Vector2 from scalar\r\nprint(Vector2() == Vector2(0, 0) and Vector2(0) == Vector2(0, 0)) # prints \"true\"\r\nprint(Vector2(12) == Vector2(12.0, 12.0)) # prints \"true\"\r\n\r\n# Vector2i from scalar\r\nprint(Vector2i() == Vector2i(0, 0) and Vector2i(0) == Vector2i(0, 0)) # prints \"true\"\r\nprint(Vector2i(12.5) == Vector2i(12, 12)) # prints \"true\"\r\n\r\n# Vector3 from scalar\r\nprint(Vector3() == Vector3(0, 0, 0) and Vector3(0) == Vector3(0, 0, 0)) # prints \"true\"\r\nprint(Vector3(12) == Vector3(12.0, 12.0, 12.0)) # prints \"true\"\r\n\r\n# Vector3i from scalar\r\nprint(Vector3i() == Vector3i(0, 0, 0) and Vector3i(0) == Vector3i(0, 0, 0)) # prints \"true\"\r\nprint(Vector3i(12.5) == Vector3i(12, 12, 12)) # prints \"true\"\r\n\r\n# Vector4 from scalar\r\nprint(Vector4() == Vector4(0, 0, 0, 0) and Vector4(0) == Vector4(0, 0, 0, 0)) # prints \"true\"\r\nprint(Vector4(12) == Vector4(12.0, 12.0, 12.0, 12.0)) # prints \"true\"\r\n\r\n# Vector4i from scalar\r\nprint(Vector4i() == Vector4i(0, 0, 0, 0) and Vector4i(0) == Vector4i(0, 0, 0, 0)) # prints \"true\"\r\nprint(Vector4i(12.5) == Vector4i(12, 12, 12, 12)) # prints \"true\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nC++ Example:\r\n```c++\r\n// Vector2 from scalar\r\nstatic_assert(Vector2(0) == Vector2(0, 0));\r\nstatic_assert(Vector2(12) == Vector2(12.0, 12.0));\r\n\r\n// Vector2i from scalar\r\nstatic_assert(Vector2i(0) == Vector2i(0, 0));\r\nstatic_assert(Vector2i(12.5) == Vector2i(12, 12));\r\n\r\n// Vector3 from scalar\r\nstatic_assert(Vector3(0) == Vector3(0, 0, 0));\r\nstatic_assert(Vector3(7) == Vector3(7.0, 7.0, 7.0));\r\nstatic_assert(Vector3(3.5) == Vector3(3.5, 3.5, 3.5));\r\n\r\n// Vector3i from scalar\r\nstatic_assert(Vector3i(0) == Vector3i(0, 0, 0));\r\nstatic_assert(Vector3i(8) == Vector3i(8, 8, 8));\r\nstatic_assert(Vector3i(12.9) == Vector3i(12, 12, 12));\r\n\r\n// Vector4 from scalar\r\nstatic_assert(Vector4(0) == Vector4(0, 0, 0, 0));\r\nstatic_assert(Vector4(1.25) == Vector4(1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25));\r\nstatic_assert(Vector4(-5) == Vector4(-5.0, -5.0, -5.0, -5.0));\r\n\r\n// Vector4i from scalar\r\nstatic_assert(Vector4i(0) == Vector4i(0, 0, 0, 0));\r\nstatic_assert(Vector4i(9) == Vector4i(9, 9, 9, 9));\r\nstatic_assert(Vector4i(-3.7) == Vector4i(-3, -3, -3, -3));\r\n```\r\n\r\n* Closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3884","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/re